		{
			dependencies: ["1BD3F090A3FA8B3C"]
			description: [
				"&eBotania&r is magic that behaves like a tech mod, which makes it the natural companion to Ars Nouveau rather than a rival."
				""
				"Everything runs on &eMana&r, generated by flowers and moved around by &eSpreaders&r firing visible bursts across your island. Start with &eLivingrock&r, a &eMana Pool&r to hold it and a &eSpreader&r to move it."
				""
				"&7Botania has no power cables, no GUIs and no config screens. Every machine is a flower, and everything it does happens in the world where you can watch it."
			]
			icon: "botania:mana_pool"
			id: "7E30500000000001"
			rewards: [{
