		{
			dependencies: ["7E30500000000001"]
			description: [
				"&eManasteel&r is the first thing worth spending mana on, and the &eTwig Wand&r is how you bind spreaders to pools and read what any flower is doing."
				""
				"Where Botania earns its place in an automation pack is the &efunctional flowers&r: a &eHopperhock&r pulls items off the ground into nearby chests, a &eRannuncarpus&r places blocks for you, an &eAgricarnation&r grows crops in a radius."
				""
				"And then there is &eCorporea&r - a wireless request network where you literally ask out loud for an item and it flies to you. Nothing else in this pack works remotely like it."
			]
			icon: "botania:twig_wand"
			id: "7E30500000000002"
