		{
			dependencies: ["1BD3F090A3FA8B3C"]
			description: [
				"&eOccultism&r automates by &esummoning something to do the work&r - no cables, no pipes, no channels."
				""
				"Draw a ritual circle in &eChalk&r, place a &eSacrificial Bowl&r, and use a &eBook of Binding&r to call up a spirit. Bind it with a &eBook of Calling&r and it becomes a familiar with a job: a Lumberjack that fells and replants trees, a Cleaner that tidies drops into chests, a Transporter that ferries items between inventories."
				""
				"&7The &eOtherworld Goggles&r let you see otherworld blocks and ores that are invisible without them - craft them early or you will wonder why a ritual won't complete."
